  "configuration_notes": [
    "Two local containers run the same pinned application source, with separate databases, Redis and sessions. Peer base URLs use Docker-local HTTP; operational examples use HTTPS.",
    "Only Docker-local names were added to the PHP capture processes\u2019 NO_PROXY; the outbound session proxy remained configured.",
    "Connection/version/POST tests succeeded in both directions. No event was published or pushed/pulled; no signing key or external message was generated.",
    "Live publication/transfer tests were omitted after automatic approval review rejected them under the earlier no-publication instruction. Distribution tables, signature handling and mixed-version feature gates were checked in the pinned source; these are not claimed as end-to-end runtime tests.",
    "Only a synthetic two-row CSV was cached and imported, with auto-publish disabled, distribution 0 and all to_ids false. No external feed was fetched.",
    "Protection and unprotection were exercised only on a new private unpublished draft. No signing or signed transfer was exercised.",
    "The Overmind server form omits collection sync controls at this commit; the text documents REST settings. Cache search still renders the legacy layout; the screenshot is the actual fallback page.",
    "The collection adds one Attribute reference to the private existing dossier, alongside Event, Object and AttributeValue references. Target ACL/value resolution behaviour was checked in source."
